<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020">
    <title>Cartman | Endpoint Agents</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/modules/endpoint-agents.css">
    <script src="/static/js/modules/standalone-page.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/static/js/core/module-definitions.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/static/js/modules/standalone-navigation.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/static/js/modules/endpoint-agents.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand-area">
            <a class="brand" href="/">
                <span class="brand-logo">C</span>
                <span>CARTMAN</span>
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="top-actions">
            <a class="secondary-button" href="/">&#8592; Dashboard</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="ea-page">
        <div class="module-header">
            <span class="category-icon purple">&#8984;</span>
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow">ENDPOINT MANAGEMENT / AGENT CONTROL</div>
                <h1>Endpoint Agents</h1>
                <p>Manage endpoint enrollment, agent versions, connectivity and collectors.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="ea-service-banner" aria-label="Agent service status">
            <span class="ea-service-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div class="ea-service-copy">
                <strong>Agent service not connected</strong>
                <span>No agent API or enrollment service is configured in this installation.</span>
            </div>
            <span class="ea-service-tag">NOT CONNECTED</span>
        </section>

        <section class="ea-stats" aria-label="Agent summary">
            <article class="ea-stat-card">
                <div class="ea-stat-top"><span>Total agents</span><span class="ea-stat-icon">&#8984;</span></div>
                <strong>—</strong>
                <span>Awaiting agent inventory</span>
            </article>
            <article class="ea-stat-card">
                <div class="ea-stat-top"><span>Online</span><span class="ea-stat-icon">&#9679;</span></div>
                <strong>—</strong>
                <span>Heartbeat data unavailable</span>
            </article>
            <article class="ea-stat-card">
                <div class="ea-stat-top"><span>Offline</span><span class="ea-stat-icon">&#9711;</span></div>
                <strong>—</strong>
                <span>Requires connectivity data</span>
            </article>
            <article class="ea-stat-card">
                <div class="ea-stat-top"><span>Pending enrollment</span><span class="ea-stat-icon">&#8635;</span></div>
                <strong>—</strong>
                <span>Enrollment workflow unavailable</span>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="ea-panel" aria-label="Agent inventory">
            <div class="ea-panel-heading">
                <div>
                    <span class="ea-kicker">FLEET MANAGEMENT</span>
                    <h2>Agent inventory</h2>
                    <p>Review registered endpoints and their reporting status.</p>
                </div>
                <span class="ea-count" data-ea-count>0 records</span>
            </div>

            <div class="ea-toolbar">
                <label class="ea-search-wrap">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">&#8981;</span>
                    <input type="search" data-ea-search placeholder="Search hostname, platform or agent ID..." aria-label="Search agents" disabled>
                </label>
                <select data-ea-status aria-label="Filter by agent status" disabled>
                    <option value="all">All statuses</option>
                    <option value="online">Online</option>
                    <option value="offline">Offline</option>
                    <option value="pending">Pending</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="ea-table-wrap">
                <table class="ea-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Endpoint</th>
                            <th>Platform</th>
                            <th>Agent version</th>
                            <th>Last check-in</th>
                            <th>Collectors</th>
                            <th>Status</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody data-ea-rows></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <div class="ea-empty-state">
                <span class="ea-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#8984;</span>
                <h3>No agent inventory available</h3>
                <p>Once an agent enrollment API and reporting service are implemented, registered endpoints will appear here.</p>
                <span class="ea-empty-note">No sample devices are being presented as real endpoints.</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="ea-collector-panel" aria-label="Collector overview">
            <div class="ea-collector-symbol" aria-hidden="true">&#9672;</div>
            <div class="ea-collector-copy">
                <span class="ea-kicker">DATA COLLECTION</span>
                <h2>Collectors</h2>
                <p>Inventory, performance and health collectors require an agent-side reporting pipeline.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ea-collector-state">
                <span class="ea-state-dot"></span>
                <span>Not configured</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer class="app-footer">
            <span>Cartman Infrastructure Management</span>
            <span>Endpoint Agents · Integration pending</span>
        </footer>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
